<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SPC year net profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SPC year net profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   5.20 vs 2.76</p>
<p>    Net				    4.11 vs 1.52</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   1.25 vs 1.0</p>
<p>NOTE: SPC Ltd is a fruit canning company based in Shepparton, Victoria.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  190.96 vs 177.95</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.06 vs 2.31</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    4.22 vs 0.11</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 1.39</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay n/a</p>
<p>Reg April 24</p>
<p>    Tax			    charge  1.09 vs credit 0.15</p>
<p>    Interest				 7.08 vs 6.02</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.14 vs 3.63</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
